        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6671, 12\" Trumbull Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trumbull Appliance Pull is available in a wide array of finishes and each one of them seem to grant this refrigerator handle a different style. The two-toned polished nickel and black grants this appliance handle a very on-trend look perfect for modern spaces while the weathered nickel finish gives it a rustic feel. Part of RK International's Trumbull Collection, the 12 inch Trumbull Appliance Handle comes packaged with all necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/trumbull-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-171\"><b>Trumbull Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/trumbull-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-671\"><b>Trumbull Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International AP-PH-6671 Trumbull Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-12-specifications.gif?v=1704354508\" width=\"573\" height=\"107\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
